Highlight queries of the web page's code blocks

These are GPUI Kit's highlight queries
(https://github.com/mesa-hills-research/gpui_kit, in
crates/component/src/highlighter/languages/, at commit aacb74c), so code
reads on the page as in the apps. GPUI Kit is under the Apache License 2.0,
whose text is in LICENSE-APACHE at the root of this repository. The queries
listed below come from the projects named with them, at the versions given,
and the others (go.scm, html.scm, javascript.scm, json.scm, kotlin.scm,
lua.scm, rust.scm and typescript.scm) from GPUI Kit's upstream,
gpui-component, under the Apache License 2.0 too. Files marked "adapted"
were changed to use the kit's highlight names. Each project is under the
MIT License, except nvim-treesitter, which is under the Apache License 2.0.
The MIT License text follows the list.

